// PMapa stats service — the metrics store. Services PUSH named metrics into it
// (fire-and-forget) and read them back by name; the values live in Redis.
//
// The contract is deliberately tiny: `Set(name, value)` / `Get(name) → value`
// plus `Inc(name, delta)` — counters MUST use Inc (atomic INCRBY server-side);
// Set is for gauges/absolute values and last-write-wins.
//
// Metric names are dot-separated, lowest cardinality first, e.g.
// "messages.sent", "posts.likes.<post_id>", "users.followers.<user_id>".
